  "details": "Hello VRC Support,\n\nWe believe we have found a bug regarding the world performance avatar gating system.\n\nWe rely heavily on the world performance gating feature. In our current setup, we have the instance limit set to Poor. However, we noticed a user was still able to join and display an avatar ranked as Very Poor. We believe we are seeing the Quest version of the avatar, but it is still explicitly marked as Very Poor inside the instance, which is quite confusing.\n\nHere are the specific details:\n\nAvatar ID: avtr_067bd920-500d-4a33-a537-cc23d06afe67\n\nIssue: The avatar is actively marked as Very Poor inside the instance despite the Poor gating threshold.\n\nCould you please look into whether this is a known bug with the gating system?\n\nThank you for your time and help!\n\nBest regards,\n\nBaltimore",
